    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Ping Latency (ms) Over Time — [P1 Outage: Latency == 0 ms | Normal: 0.5 - 5 ms]",
      "description": "🚨 P1 CRITICAL OUTAGE: Triggers when router_up == 0 OR latency == 0 ms for >= 5s (Power-off / Cable Disconnected).\n\n✅ RECOVERY: Triggers when router_up == 1 AND latency > 0 ms (Link Stabilized at ~0.55 ms).\n\n⚠️ LATENCY THRESHOLDS: Healthy Normal (< 20 ms), Latency Warning (20 - 50 ms), High Latency Spike (> 50 ms).",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "router_ping_latency_ms",
          "legendFormat": "TP-Link TL-WR845N (192.168.1.2) Ping Latency [0 ms = OUTAGE | Normal < 10 ms]",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
